  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ピクニック用のお皿。　料理や気分で使い分けられるよう　色の種類が　豊富。グリーンは　かなりの　人気商品。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "피크닉용 접시. 요리나 기분에 따라 골라서 쓸 수 있게 색의 종류가 다양하다. 그린 컬러는 상당한 인기 상품이다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "野餐用的盤子。提供豐富的顏色，以搭配各種不同的料理和心情。綠色的盤子非常熱銷。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une assiette de pique-nique. Il en existe de nombreuses couleurs pour les accorder à l’ambiance ou au menu. La verte est particulièrement populaire.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diesen Picknickteller gibt es in verschiedenen Farben, damit man je nach Laune oder Speise variieren kann. Der grüne Teller ist ziemlich beliebt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un plato de pícnic. Los distintos colores en los que viene ofrecen posibilidades infinitas. Esta versión verde es muy popular.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Piatto da picnic. È disponibile in un ampio assortimento di colori tra cui si può scegliere a seconda del cibo e dell’umore. Il verde è molto popolare.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A dish for picnics. Comes in plenty of colors to choose from based on the food or the mood. The green variety is quite popular.",
